{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","大和与加布兽"],["/names/en","Yamato & Gabumon"],["/description_i18n/cn","大和是性格冷静且责任感强的小学五年级学生，持有友情徽章。加布兽是他的搭档数码宝贝，十分重视伙伴。"],["/description_i18n/en","Yamato is a level-headed, responsible fifth grader who holds the Crest of Friendship. His partner is Gabumon, a Digimon who cares deeply about his friends."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","俺たちに任せろ！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","俺たちに任せろ!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/jp","俺たちに任せろ！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","stt"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"俺たちに任せろ！","text":"交给我们吧！","target_transcript":"俺たちに任せろ！","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"俺たちに任せろ！","text":"Leave it to us!","target_transcript":"俺たちに任せろ!","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/jp","また強くなったな!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"また強くなったな!","text":"又变强了啊！","target_transcript":"","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"また強くなったな!","text":"Even stronger now!","target_transcript":"","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","ガブモンワープ進化！メタルガルルモン！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","ガブモンワープ進化! メダルガリルモン!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/jp","ガブモンワープ進化！メタルガルルモン！"],[