translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"やったな！","text":"成功了！","target_transcript":"やったな！","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/4/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"やったな！","text":"We did it!","target_transcript":"やったな!","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/cn","俺たちが力になるよ。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","俺たちが力になるよ."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/jp","俺たちが力になるよ。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"俺たちが力になるよ。","text":"我们会助你一臂之力。","target_transcript":"俺たちが力になるよ。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/unit_voice_lines/5/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"俺たちが力になるよ。","text":"We'll lend you our strength.","target_transcript":"俺たちが力になるよ.","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","いい音色だね。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","いい音色だね."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/jp","いい音色だね。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"いい音色だね。","text":"这声音真好听。","target_transcript":"いい音色だね。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"いい音色だね。","text":"That sounds lovely.","target_transcript":"いい音色だね.","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","毛皮がずれたのか，整えてやるよ。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","毛皮がずれたのか 整えてやるよ."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/jp","毛皮がずれたのか？整えてやるよ。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/jp","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/cn",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"毛皮がずれたのか？整えてやるよ。","text":"毛皮歪了？我帮你整理好。","target_transcript":"毛皮がずれたのか，整えてやるよ。","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/saved_voice_translations/en",{"source_language":"jp","source_text":"毛皮がずれたのか？整えてやるよ。","text":"Has your pelt slipped? I'll straighten it out for you.","target_transcript":"毛皮がずれたのか 整えてやるよ.","provider":"Codex AI-generated","review_status":"AI editorial review, 2026-10-24; not human-reviewed"}],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","很有用，谢谢。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","This helps a lot, thanks."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Thank you."],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","大和有着冷静而认真的性格，行事谨慎且小心。因此，他有时会与凭直觉行动的太一发生冲突。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Yamato Ishida is calm, serious, and careful. That puts him at odds with Taichi sometimes, especially when Taichi decides to go with his gut."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","由于外公是法国人，大和实际上有着四分之一的法国血统。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Yamato's grandfather is French, which makes Yamato one-quarter French."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","父母离婚后，大和与父亲一起生活。他很擅长烹饪，在冒险途中曾教过太一厨艺。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","After his parents divorced, Yamato lived with his father. He is good at cooking, and during the adventure he taught Taichi some useful cooking tips."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","大和对年幼的弟弟非常关心，偶尔会对弟弟有些过度保护。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Yamato cares deeply about his younger brother. Sometimes, that makes him a little too protective."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","大和对音乐很感兴趣，擅长吹口琴。当大和吹响口琴时，加布兽会静静倾听。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Yamato loves music and plays the harmonica well. When he plays, Gabumon listens quietly."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","加布兽不太喜欢下水，因为担心会淋湿毛皮。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Gabumon avoids water when he can. He really hates getting his fur wet."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","加布兽身上的毛皮是由加鲁鲁兽残留的数据拼凑而成的，以起到震慑敌人、保护身体的作用。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Gabumon's fur is made from leftover Garurumon data. It protects him and helps make him look more intimidating to enemies."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","加布兽容易害羞，不愿在他人面前脱下毛皮。在和大家下水泡澡时，还会因此躲在角落里独自为难。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Gabumon gets shy without his fur, so taking it off in front of everyone is hard for him. During bath time, he usually ends up hiding in a corner, not sure what to do."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","加布兽有时会发现大和在害羞。而当加布兽直白地说出这点时，大和则会别过头小声反驳，表示害羞的是加布兽才对。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Gabumon has noticed before that Yamato gets embarrassed. But when Gabumon points it out, Yamato looks away and quietly insists that Gabumon is the shy one."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","大和有时会有些别扭，不愿向他人吐露自己的内心。但在与同伴们经历众多冒险后，他学会了更加坦率地面对自己。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Yamato has a hard time saying what he really feels. But after everything he goes through with his friends, he slowly learns to express his feelings."]]}